Subject: [PATCH 15/25] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../Byte Formatter/{Byte+Byte.Formatter.swift => Byte.swift}      | 0
 ...inaryInteger+Byte.Size.Formatter.swift => BinaryInteger.swift} | 0
 ...aryFloatingPoint+Formatter.swift => BinaryFloatingPoint.swift} | 0
 .../{StringProtocol+Formatter.swift => StringProtocol.swift}      | 0
 ...aryInteger+Radix.Formatter.swift => Swift.BinaryInteger.swift} | 0
 ...it.Pattern.Mask+Bit.Formatter.swift => Bit.Pattern.Mask.swift} | 0
 6 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-byte-formatter/Byte Formatter/{Byte+Byte.Formatter.swift => Byte.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-byte-formatter/Byte Size Formatter/{BinaryInteger+Byte.Size.Formatter.swift => BinaryInteger.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-format-formatter/Format Formatter/{BinaryFloatingPoint+Formatter.swift => BinaryFloatingPoint.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-format-formatter/Format Formatter/{StringProtocol+Formatter.swift => StringProtocol.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-radix-formatter/Radix Formatter/{BinaryInteger+Radix.Formatter.swift => Swift.BinaryInteger.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Formatter/BitPattern/{Bit.Pattern.Mask+Bit.Formatter.swift => Bit.Pattern.Mask.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-byte-formatter/Byte Formatter/Byte+Byte.Formatter.swift b/Sources/Formatter/Absorbed/swift-byte-formatter/Byte Formatter/Byte.swift
similarity index 100%
